# Double-rail / snake score side mirror: cue checks with strong opposite side and returns to the first cushion as the third cue rail.
# Goal: high-speed bottom/top/bottom rail pattern from the opposite side; only two physical cushions produce the three-cushion count before red.
table three_cushion_carom_10ft
game three_cushion
ball cue at (1.279, 6.737)
ball yellow at (0.593, 4.526)
ball red at (2.927070378, 1.810729986)
cue_strike(default).mass_ratio(1.0).energy_loss(0.08)
simulation(default)
  .preset(three_cushion)
  .max_events(36)
trace(max_events: 36)
shot(cue).heading(193.812116321deg).speed(219.897581189ips).tip(side: 0.074494772R, height: 0.096268040R).using(default)
